Families can come in for a Happy Meal or grab a coffee at McCafe, and a drive-thru lane means customers can get lunch without leaving their car. Customers can eat in or use the drive-thru to collect their order. The branch trades seven days a week, so it suits families, shoppers and anyone passing through the CBD who wants a quick meal.', source_urls = json_insert(CASE WHEN json_valid(source_urls) AND json_type(source_urls) = 'array' THEN source_urls ELSE '[]' END, '$[#]', 'https://www.mcdonalds.co.za/location/mcdonalds-polokwane-cbd'), description_enriched_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'mcdonalds-polokwane-cbd-polokwane-central' AND description = 'McDonald''s Polokwane CBD is a fast-food restaurant on the corner of Market and Grobler Streets in Polokwane Central.' AND description_enriched_at IS NULL AND length(COALESCE(description, '')) < 700
